Here is the commit message:
Fix signedness error introduced by 599b800b, also fix
 spacing.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by a signedness error introduced in a previous commit (599b800b), which likely involved improper handling of data types that could lead to unexpected behavior or crashes when processing out-of-band messages. The modifications in the patch aimed to correct this by ensuring proper type casting and improving function clarity.

Here is the patch:
